Today is my first day at the office.
I am a software engineer.
I get up early in the morning.
I prepare my bag.
What all is needed for the office?
I look in the bag.
I have my laptop.
I also have my ID documents.
My age is written there.
I am thirty-one years old.
Everything is fine.
But there is one problem.
I look at my mobile phone.
I do not have a local phone number.
I only have a Mexico number.
A new number is necessary here.
Therefore, today I also need a new SIM card.
Now I am ready.
I take the bag.
I go to the office.
